  "text": "Skip to content\n\u2728 Hablamos espa\u00f1ol - Bienvenidos a Casa de Confianza\n\u2728 Hablamos espa\u00f1ol - Bienvenidos a Casa de Confianza\n\u2728 Hablamos espa\u00f1ol - Bienvenidos a Casa de Confianza\n\u2728 Hablamos espa\u00f1ol - Bienvenidos a Casa de Confianza\n\u2728 Hablamos espa\u00f1ol - Bienvenidos a Casa de Confianza\n\u2728 Hablamos espa\u00f1ol - Bienvenidos a Casa de Confianza\n\u2728 Hablamos espa\u00f1ol - Bienvenidos a Casa de Confianza\n\u2728 Hablamos espa\u00f1ol - Bienvenidos a Casa de Confianza\n\u2728 Hablamos espa\u00f1ol - Bienvenidos a Casa de Confianza\n\u2728 Hablamos espa\u00f1ol - Bienvenidos a Casa de Confianza\nHOME\nABOUT\nSERVICES\nFINANCING PLAN\nMEDIA\nRESULTS\nBLOG\nCONTACT\n EN  ES\n(480) 493-5921\nBOOK NOW\nWELCOME TO\nHAUS OF CONFIDENCE\n\nA PREMIER MEDSPA IN SCOTTSDALE\n\n\nBOOK NOW\nBECAUSE RESULTS ARE THE ONLY OPTION.\nHAUS OF CONFIDENCE\nCASA DE CONFIANZA\nRedefining Beauty, Redefining You\n\nWelcome to Haus of Confidence, Scottsdale\u2019s premier destination for transformative aesthetic treatments. We\u2019re not your regular medical spa \u2013 we\u2019re game changers, dedicated to revolutionizing the way you look and feel.\n\nSpecializing in what we call LIPO AWAY, which is an awake liposuction procedure, our team comprises some of the industry\u2019s finest professionals. We\u2019re committed to utilizing the most advanced and sophisticated technology available today, ensuring that every treatment delivers exceptional results. But it\u2019s not just about the procedures \u2013 it\u2019s about the experience too. Here at Haus of Confidence in Scottsdale, Arizona, we combine our expertise with a passion for creating a fun and memorable journey for each of our clients. From the moment you step inside, you\u2019ll feel welcomed, valued, and supported every step of the way.\n\nRemember, investing in yourself is one of the most important decisions you can make, and at Haus of Confidence, we\u2019re dedicated to making sure that investment feels worth it.\n\nJoin us and discover a new level of confidence, beauty, and empowerment, and welcome to this beauty revolution.\n\nSCHEDULE A CONSULTATION\nTAKE IT FROM MY GUT, PUT IT IN MY BUTT\nOUR FAT TRANSFER SERVICES\nINTRODUCING OUR \u201cHAUS\u201d FAVORITES\nDiscover our leading physician-supervised medspa in Scottsdale, Arizona, where our expertly trained professionals seamlessly blend advanced medical-grade technology with the serene ambiance of a luxury spa.\nBefore\nAfter\nLIPOAWAY\nExperience the transformative power of our cutting-edge vibration-supported body sculpting and minimally invasive liposuction procedures, delivering the immediate and long-lasting results you desire, all with minimized risks.\nLearn More\nBefore\nAfter\nFAT TRANSFER\nAchieve natural augmentations without concerns about risks, scarring, anesthesia, or implant rejection. Experience safe, immediate, and enduring results by utilizing your own body fat.\nLearn More\nBefore\nAfter\nDERMAL FILLERS\nTry our FDA-approved fillers offering a versatile solution, that effectively targets wrinkles, enhances lip volume, replenishes soft-tissue volume, addresses scar depressions, and volumizes facial lines and folds.\nLearn More\nUNLEASH THE CONFIDENCE\nWITHIN YOU\n\nHaus of Confidence aims to empower women worldwide to embrace their best selves and unlock their full potential.\n\nYou could be our next success story \u2013 call us to get started on unleashing your confidence.\n\nCALL NOW\nTAKE IT FROM MY BACK, PUT IT IN MY RACK\nAwake Liposuction &\nNatural Fat Transfer\n\nIntroducing Lipo Away in Scottsdale, a treatment that can help you achieve fat reduction, removing 2-5 inches of stubborn fat in one session from any part of your body, all without the need for general anesthesia. You can now utilize your own body fat to naturally enhance specific areas, mitigating common risks associated with alternative methods.\n\nTry it here at Haus of Confidence.\n\nBOOK NOW\nAbdomen\nThighs\n\nGynecomastia\n\nWaist\n\nArms\n\nNatural Butt Transfer\n\nBra Roll\n\nKnees, Calves & Ankles\n\nNatural Breast Augmentation\n\nChin\n\nSuprapubic\nOUR SUCCESS STORIES\nAND OUR PATIENTS\u2019 EXPERIENCE\n\n\"Best medspa. Girl had Botox done, looks great . She is coming back for her lips and more.\"\n\nJosh D.\n\n\"I moved from Newport Beach, CA and finally found an amazing med spa in Scottsdale! Sara, the injector, was professional, knowledgeable and welcoming.\"\n\nSarah P.\n\n\"Sara was absolutely FANTASTIC! She understood what I was looking for and went above and beyond to make my lips look fabulous.\"\n\nBly H.\n\nOUR SERVICES\nFace\nSkin\nHair\nProducts\nPrivacy Policy\nHOURS\nMonday to Friday - 9 AM- 7 PM\nSAT- 9 AM - 4 PM\nSunday OFF\nCONTACT US\n\nCall Us: (480) 493-5921\n\nEmail: info@hausofconfidence.com\n\nScottsdale Location\n\n4205 N Winfield Scott Plaza Suite 6,\nScottsdale, AZ 85251\n\nGilbert Location\n\n3303 S Lindsay Rd STE 105,\nGilbert, AZ 85297\n\nFacebook-f\n \nInstagram\n \nYoutube\n \nSnapchat\n \nTwitter\n \n\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605 Over 1000+ 5-star reviews | @ 2026 - Haus of Confidence | All Rights Reserved.",
